     7	//!
     8	//! Behaviour (including the quirks and bugs of the original) is reproduced
     9	//! exactly: same order of checks, same messages, same return codes, same
    10	//! `malloc` success/failure semantics, same `atoi`/`strncpy`/`%s` semantics.
